@b <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/config-studio/legalruleml-mapping#>
@p lrmlmm=<http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/metamodel#>
@p rulemm=<http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/rule-metamodel#>
@p vocab=<http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/vocab#>
@p ins=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/instrument#>
@p pty=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/party#>
@p elg=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/eligibility#>
@p dcterms=<http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
%R Lrml fm mork:RDF lb "LegalRuleML metamodel instances"
%X
lrmlmm:Obligation RE
lrmlmm:Prohibition RE
lrmlmm:Permission RE
lrmlmm:Right RE
lrmlmm:Reparation RE
lrmlmm:TemporalCharacteristic RE
lrmlmm:LegalReference RE
lrmlmm:Authority RE
lrmlmm:Jurisdiction RE
%T Concepts in Lrml
ObligationConcept C ra lrmlmm:Obligation
ProhibitionConcept C ra lrmlmm:Prohibition
PermissionConcept C ra lrmlmm:Permission
RightConcept C ra lrmlmm:Right
ReparationConcept C ra lrmlmm:Reparation
TemporalConcept C ra lrmlmm:TemporalCharacteristic
ReferenceConcept C ra lrmlmm:LegalReference
AuthorityConcept C ra lrmlmm:Authority
JurisdictionConcept C ra lrmlmm:Jurisdiction
BearerConcept C p lrmlmm:Bearer
AuxiliaryConcept C p lrmlmm:AuxiliaryParty
%M Scheme md mork:ReviewMode
Role_T MD xt pty:Role c role
Role_T_Label M cb Role_T xr rdfs:label r "rdfs:label|rulemm:symbolForData"
!T Scheme sh:declare _:d1
!T _:d1 sh:prefix "lrmlmm"
!T _:d1 sh:namespace "http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/metamodel#"^xsd:anyURI
!T Starts_Shape rdf:type sh:NodeShape
!T Starts_Shape sh:property _:s1
!T _:s1 sh:path lrmlmm:hasStatusDevelopment
!T _:s1 sh:hasValue vocab:Starts
